                                        "entry_id": "64dfffe3-b943-37a6-b4dc-2e19c7dcb251",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A plant (or the haploid phase in its life cycle) which produces gametes by mitosis in order to produce a zygote."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c76d515f-e32f-490e-ae86-da25cb216492",
                                                "sense_id": "b58f737a-0c38-3810-b381-2a4b9b1d17da",
                                                "text": "In liverworts like Marchantia, which lives in most soggy places worldwide, the gametophyte is the dominant phase – the thing you would think of as the plant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
